# crawler - tracked ground tank. 24x28, 2 frames, straight top-down, faces DOWN (gun toward the player).
# light: top-left. K exterior outline; seams where hull meets treads and around the turret dome.
# Treads cols 0-5 and 18-23 (4px links, period 4 rows); olive hull cols 6-17 with rear engine slats,
# front glacis one step darker; olive dome turret (10px) with a 2x2 red sensor; steel gun to row 26.
# Palette: olive a b c d e, steel 3 4, red n r, K (10 colours).
# Frames: 0 tread phase 0, 1 tread phase +2 rows (half a link) - 120 ms each, loop. Only tread pixels change.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline
3 #4a5a82  steel-2
4 #7184ad  steel-3
a #1b2622  olive-0
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
n #92203a  red-1
r #da3d4f  red-2
ramp steel 3 4
ramp olive a b c d e
ramp red n r
